# Tell GitHub's Linguist to highlight .mdix files using TOML syntax.
# This is a temporary approximation until DixScript is submitted to
# github-linguist/linguist as a first-class language.
*.mdix linguist-language=TOML

# Treat .mdix files as text (no line-ending conversion)
*.mdix text eol=lf

# Treat compiled/encrypted output as binary
*.mdix.enc binary
*.mdix.key binary
*.mdix.au  binary
*.bin      binary
